msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/cloud-dedicated.rst:80
msgid ""
"Email sent from Mattermost Cloud Dedicated uses SendGrid, and the "
"connection to SendGrid is encrypted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/cloud-dedicated.rst:83
msgid "Audit and observability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/cloud-dedicated.rst:85
msgid ""
"Mattermost Cloud Dedicated provides access to :doc:`audit and system logs"
" </administration-guide/manage/logging>` generated by the application."
msgstr ""

